    "notes": "Whole readout read. No Chapter 2 content: the social policy and employment paragraph concerns general labour-market policy (unemployment, vocational training, minimum assistance, Youth Guarantee, labour relations law), which is outside the Chapter 2 boundary. Theme items come from the information society and media paragraph. Not extracted: the 112 European emergency number (R20), digital education (digital skills not linked to an in-scope recommendation), media law alignment, education, culture, research and innovation, and the Smart Specialisation Strategy (no digital content stated). cluster and chapter left empty: the readout gives no chapter numbers, following MKD-EU-2026-005. Speaker recorded as 'the Commission' as printed. The meeting date (23 January 2025) is stated in the first paragraph but not in the claims, so event_date is set only where a claim states its own date. Second-pass check done (G3 condition 2), see review/RUN-2026-01/second_pass/."
